{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With the help of your ally, the <strong>Holy Flask</strong>, guide <strong>Sepan</strong> to the lost <strong>Seven Flasks of Power</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Why do the inhabitants of this world seem unable to see reality? What is that scream far away ? Will you find your way through the darkness? Will you survive this unpredictable world?<br>Dive into <strong>Sepan and the Seven Flasks</strong>, overcome obstacles, and gather all the <strong>Seven Flasks</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The <strong>Holy Flask</strong> watches over you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Story Mode with three difficulty levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Several mini-games integrated into Story Mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Four unlockable mini-games: runner, reflex, rhythm, and QTE</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Local and global leaderboards for mini-games</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>[Optional] </strong>Twitch integration: allows viewers to interact with certain mini-games</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Unlockable Mini-Games</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Scooter Run (runner)</strong>: three difficulty levels, endless mode, Twitch chat integration</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dance (rhythm)</strong>: three dance styles, non-stop mode, Twitch chat integration</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Reflex vs. a dog (QTE)</strong>: three difficulty levels, non-stop mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chain Jumps (timing)</strong>: three difficulty levels, non-stop mode</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A story mixing complexity, mystery, and humor</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Numerous references to internet culture and video games</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hidden characters to discover</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A Stalker lurking in the shadows, to avoid at all costs</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We would like to thank the Holy Flask for its exceptional contribution.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Meet Mr. Rock","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3919840/78167c5ba35af0e84b92c5926bf7bf4f3414e1ff.jpg"},{"name":"Talk to the Ancient","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3919840/c62ef2780364928183cfe7945441b543b5d1b22a.jpg"},{"name":"Jump !","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3919840/28e841d10253c33c325bec2613c68e35963b820c.jpg"},{"name":"Wrong way !","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3919840/b829a346eee4a90d12316edbd96bf2859471ac12.jpg"},{"name":"Who\u2019s out here tonight ?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3919840/e0357ed798e5b0c818fb875bf5f6f62d71dc207b.jpg"},{"name":"Behind the bar","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3919840/d6bf8290e2b160c6c2d76724a92eaa5e024caea3.jpg"},{"name":"I can't see !","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3919840/720d0a5052fd87cacf051ef2b2eeaaa1e4c80969.jpg"},{"name":"Knee-Standing Dance","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3919840/ac74b8c9e41ec116cd03d811f4d04b0c7664c16d.jpg"},{"name":"Escaped !","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3919840/4f8640cc35e89cd54111e78c55b3f1e800c6ea91.jpg"},{"name":"A little ride on a scooter","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3919840/9a76ad51b41bf5dff1d95fc01b5951ec529435a7.jpg"}],"total":20},"background":"https://store.akamai.ste